    "detailed_description": "Springfield\u2019s most Awesome Halloween Ever!<br><br>It\u2019s Springfield\u2019s best Halloween yet! Help carve Pumpkins at Grandma\u2019s then explore Haunted Mansions, Pinecreek\u2019s Pumpkin Trail, ride a Ghost Train &amp; awesome Phantom Express to Spooksville.<br><br>Join a Halloween Parade and Fright Night Cruise. Suddenly it\u2019s Halloween and time for nighttime Trick or Treating. Kids get lots of Treats, and a scary Trick or two! They share out their Treats at home then it\u2019s time for bed.<br><br>Halloween : Trick or Treat 3 is crammed full of Ghosts &amp; Ghouls, fantabulous Hog scenes and lots of puzzles for players of all ages and guaranteeing hours of fun &amp; enjoyment.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a Truly Amazing Haunted Mansion<br></li><li>Ride the Sensational Spooksville Express<br></li><li>3 Game Modes, Casual, Challenge, Extreme<br></li><li>Great Wallpapers, Music Player, Bonus Puzzles<br></li><li>Sensational Trick or Treating in Springfield<br></li><li>Stunning Hogs and Superb Mini Puzzles<br></li><li>Highly Original Storyline &amp; Photo Album</li></ul>",
